      <p begin="00:20.230" end="00:23.390" ttm:agent="v1">I put it in her nose, it's gon' make her pussy leak</p>
      <p begin="00:23.390" end="00:26.130" ttm:agent="v1">Pussy niggas told, ain't gon' wake up out they sleep</p>
      <p begin="00:26.130" end="00:29.230" ttm:agent="v1">You can't hear that switch, but you can hear them niggas scream</p>
      <p begin="00:29.230" end="00:31.970" ttm:agent="v1">All my hoes do shrooms, nigga, all my hoes do coke</p>
      <p begin="00:31.970" end="00:36.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Twenty carat ring, I put my fingers down her throat (Uh, uh, uh)</p>
