      <p begin="00:47.220" end="00:50.100" ttm:agent="v1">She think 'cause she exotic bitch, she attractive</p>
      <p begin="00:50.100" end="00:53.990" ttm:agent="v1">That's that shit'll get you put up out the section, brrt</p>
      <p begin="00:53.990" end="00:55.960" ttm:agent="v1">And the motto still the same</p>
      <p begin="00:55.960" end="00:59.070" ttm:agent="v1">Ball like I won a championship game</p>
      <p begin="00:59.070" end="01:01.940" ttm:agent="v1">You know these hoes hungry, they gon' fuck for a name</p>
