      <p begin="01:19.050" end="01:22.240" ttm:agent="v1">Bring a friend, bitch, we fucked 'em at the same time</p>
      <p begin="01:22.240" end="01:25.020" ttm:agent="v1">I'm a different nigga, no, we not the same kind</p>
