      <p begin="02:57.080" end="02:59.430" ttm:agent="v1">Young throwed nigga, sellin' lows, is you like that?</p>
      <p begin="02:59.430" end="03:00.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Holy water, Holy water, yeah)</p>
